Datadog catalogs (data/catalogs/datadog/), generated by scripts/engine/sync_datadog_catalog.py
from DataDog/documentation at commit 12f7b8d3cc0cea32358affe1ec0fe99fb09e13b0:
https://github.com/DataDog/documentation

attributes.toml: the name, type, group and products of each row of the "Default Standard
Attributes" table (hugo/content/en/standard-attributes/_index.md), reformatted. Datadog's
descriptions are not copied; nothing else was changed in the data. A name the table lists
twice is one row, with the products of both.

